rustora is a Rust port of OpenRA. Its code is derived from the OpenRA source code, release-20250330.

The rustora authors are:
    * Daniel Strecker (daniel-x)

rustora is derived from the work of the OpenRA developers and contributors. The following list is
copied from the AUTHORS file of OpenRA release-20250330:

