The original Command & Conquer: Red Alert game content was created by Westwood Studios and is owned
by Electronic Arts. It is not part of this repository and is installed separately, as in OpenRA.

Special thanks go to the original teams at Westwood Studios and EA for creating the classic games
which OpenRA and rustora build upon.
